} } \right]$$

$${A^4} = \left[ {\matrix{
1 & 0 & 0 \cr
0 & 4 & 0 \cr
0 & 0 & 1 \cr

} } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
1 & 0 & 0 \cr
0 & 4 & 0 \cr
0 & 0 & 1 \cr

} } \right] = \left[ {\matrix{
1 & 0 & 0 \cr
0 & {16} & 0 \cr
0 & 0 & 1 \cr

} } \right]$$

